Recommends: alsa-utils, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, pulseaudio-utils, wireplumber
Description: unofficial Linux control panel for the TASCAM UH-7000
 Selects the UH-7000 USB Audio 2.0 configuration on hotplug and registers the
 device with the stock snd_usb_audio driver. Provides a per-user control
 service, Qt Quick panel, cautious read-only vendor diagnostics, ALSA/PipeWire
 profiles, and feedback-safe playback preflight checks.
